Design references and acknowledgements
--------------------------------------

ntprof (https://github.com/netlab-wisconsin/ntprof), GPL-2.0, and the NTProf
paper (NSDI '25). nvmetea's NVMe/TCP hook selection draws on ntprof's design
documentation:
  - the sk_user_data transport test,
  - per-thread contexts in per-CPU slots,
  - the receive data-phase busy/wait split,
  - skb receive timestamps,
  - the fentry attach-stall handling,
  - Latency Amplification Degree.
nvmetea does not copy ntprof source code.

